      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA FLAVOUR (1) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 5 lengths from the winner (30.47). Form here at the trip sound including five wins. Rates on top in this line up. CAKE IS YUMMY (2) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when second (19.22) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Can find the frame this time. BOSS BANDIT (3) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (19.19) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has ability and is one of the better chances. CYCLONE RANGER (8) placed last time and is worth some thought.",
